# Conformance probe pack: the `json` mirror of the sequential probe packs of
# spec 0.21 (sequential extents and counts). Public. No kinds. It maps every
# key and list those packs map, each at a member of its own name, so a vector
# can hand a sequential pack any entity and read back what one decodes.
format     conformance-extents-json
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
field   probe.x  x  int
field   probe.y  y  int
field   probe.z  z  int
group   probe.nums  nums
  field  probe.val  .  int
end
group   probe.recs  recs
  field  probe.x  x  int
  field  probe.y  y  int
end
group   probe.items  items
  field  probe.qty  qty  int
  group  probe.subs  subs
    field  probe.val  val  int
  end
end
